d14ced44 x6 T = x · (y ∘ y) = x & x · (y · z) = x · (z ∘ y) & x · ((x · y) ∘ y) = x · y
1. 12 laws of order <= 3 implied on the corpus; 12 proved by E; 10 emergent
  * x · (x · x) = x
    x · (x ∘ x) = x
  * x · (y · y) = x
  * x · ((x · x) · x) = x
  * x · ((x ∘ x) · x) = x
  * x · ((y · y) · x) = x
  * x · ((y ∘ y) · x) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (x · x)) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (x ∘ x)) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (y · y)) = x
  * x · (x ∘ (y ∘ y)) = x
2. shadow T + (x·y = x∘y):
   => x·y=x              True
   => x·y=y              False
   => x·x=x              True
   => x·y=y·x            False
   => (x·y)·z=x·(y·z)    True
   => x·(x·y)=y          False
   => (x·y)·y=x          True
   => x·(y·z)=x·y        True
